SUMMARY:Puzzle Social
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261222T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261222T150000
UID:6ad779ffa85a2c003380c4bf@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us and other local puzzle enthusiasts for an afternoon o
