DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261214T160000
UID:69b1e89e4dacf581ff81474b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of classic movies. Tea & coffee will 
 be served.\nRemember the Night (1940)\nLove blooms between a sympathetic a
 ttorney and the comely shoplifter he has taken home for the Christmas holi
 day.\nNo registration required.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69b1e89e4dacf581ff81474b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
