DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T150000
UID:6af4f02115292a005cfbb014@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for free\, welcoming workshops designed to support sen
 iors in our community!\nViviana Filazzola\, COSTI Elderly Persons’ Centr
 e Co-ordinator\, will share information on community programs and benefits
  available to seniors. You will learn about tips for maintaining wellness 
 and social connection\, information on pensions\, health services\, local 
 supports and how to access resources in your community.
LOCATION:Humber Summit\, Auditorium\, Lower level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6af4f02115292a005cfbb014
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
