DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261215T150000
UID:6afb9ea5f018c30033444366@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a creative afternoon of poetry and discussion
 . Bring you own poems or poems you admire. Share your words in a supporti
 ve atmosphere\, respond to the poems of others\, receive writing tips\, an
 d explore the works of a wide range of contemporary poets.\nThis is a drop
 -in program\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Taylor Memorial\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6afb9ea5f018c30033444366
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
