BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seniors' Social - Silent Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261229T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261229T150000
UID:6b00e7f3d164f314d93d23f7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Calling all older adults! Come join us at Morningside library 
 every month\, on the last Tuesday.\nEnjoy a variety of topics\, guest spea
 kers\, lively conversation\, & fun activities!\nDecember’s social will b
 e a Silent Book Club! Bring your own literature or enjoy the library’s b
 ooks & magazines. Read for 30 mins\, then participate in a discussion abo
 ut what everyone has read.\nLight refreshments will be served!  Drop in!
