UID:6afb39c34653e9002c388112@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The topic of making funeral arrangements is something often co
 nsidered from from time-to-time but rarely discussed planning ahead for. 
 ​This interactive presentation addresses the advantages of pre-arranging
  a funeral\, including the benefits of planning and the steps involved in 
 the planning process. It will include a Q & A with a funeral pre-planner s
 pecialist.\nPlease register for us to gauge attendance expectations. Drop-
 ins welcome.
LOCATION:Palmerston\, Program Room
