 and in the community.\nEach week\, staff will highlight services at the li
 brary that you may want to become more familiar with and answer any additi
 onal questions to make the most of you library membership. Feel free to br
 ing your own device to follow along as we walk through accessing these onl
 ine resources:\nJanuary 9 - E-books\, Digital Magazines and Newspapers\nJ
 anuary 16 - Digital Movies and Music\nJanuary 23 - Museum and Arts Passes\
 nJanuary 30 - eLearning\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all part
 icipants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.
