DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270222T200000
UID:6afcbc0b0ad4ed003a03df0b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the last Monday of every month for a special screen
 ing celebrating the best in cinema! We’ll be featuring acclaimed films c
 reated by Academy Award winners and nominees. Grab a seat\, settle in\, an
 d enjoy a great movie with fellow film lovers.\nDrop in!\nFebruary feature
 : Moonlight- 1hr 51min\nA look at three defining chapters in the life of 
 Chiron\, a young black man growing up in Miami. His epic journey to manhoo
 d is guided by the kindness\, support and love of the community that helps
  raise him.
LOCATION:Mount Pleasant\, Basement program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6afcbc0b0ad4ed003a03df0b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
