DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T193000
UID:6af2522d4d6c26856b93d487@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Bring some well-loved clothing items for a mend or refresh! Le
 arn or practice how to mend wear and tear\, or add some embroidered embell
 ishments to showcase your own style.\nThis program provides space\, help\,
  and materials for learning mending and embroidery techniques.  Participan
 ts will be introduced to a craft that promotes sustainability through a fu
 n\, affordable\, and beautiful way to mend and embellish clothing or other
  textiles.\nRegistration is optional\, drop-ins welcome. Note that this is
  not a class but we can provide some resources and supplies for learning 
 and practicing.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information 
 on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public L
 ibraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will on
