BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Title Line-up: The Things We Never Say v. Persepolis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270222T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270222T140000
UID:6ae632c429c3d6003333d109@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in for a book discussion on life during regime change. Ou
 r two contenders come from very different places but face many of the same
  challenges\, from education to family perception. As we compare and contr
 ast these literary works based on real events\, maybe we will have more qu
 estions than answers. Let's ask them anyway.\nWe will vote on a winner at 
 the end of the discussion.\nCopies of the titles can be placed on hold at 
 your local library.
LOCATION:Maryvale\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae632c429c3d6003333d109
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
